{% for product in collections.all.products %}
  {% comment %} Inline styles {% endcomment %}
  <div style="width:33%; float:left; padding:10px;">
    {% comment %}
      1. 'img_url' is deprecated.
      2. No conditional check to ensure 'product.featured_image' exists.
      3. Using the 'master' image size can unnecessarily increase the image payload and negatively impact page performance and CRO results.
    {% endcomment %}
    <img src="{{ product.featured_image | img_url: 'master' }}">

    {% comment %} Inline styles {% endcomment %}
    <h3 style="font-size:22px;">{{ product.title }}</h3>

    {% comment %}
      1. The 'rte' class is missing.
      2. A <div> should be used instead of a <p> to avoid broken HTML considering the HTML tags coming from the product description.
    {% endcomment %}
    <p>{{ product.description }}</p>

    {% comment %}
      1. There is no need to use a metafield when the product's 'inventory_quantity' attribute is already available.
      2. The stock message should only be displayed when the inventory meets the required condition.
    {% endcomment %}
    <span>Only {{ product.metafields.custom.stock }} left — hurry!</span>

    {% comment %}
      Using document.write() is render-blocking and provides no meaningful benefit here.
      A regular <a> element can be used instead.
    {% endcomment %}
    <script>
      document.write('<a href="{{ product.url }}">Buy now</a>');
    </script>
  </div>
{% endfor %}

